@host = http://localhost:5091

### Search (lexical). Add &tags=finding&tags=disorder to filter, &limit=, &page= or &cursor=
GET {{host}}/api/concepts/search?q=chest pain&limit=5
Accept: application/json

### Typo tolerant: runs only when no word matches
GET {{host}}/api/concepts/search?q=chest pian

### Suggest while typing
GET {{host}}/api/concepts/suggest?q=chest pa&limit=8

### Concept details (replace the id with one from your data)
GET {{host}}/api/concepts/{{conceptId}}

### Children, parents, synonyms
GET {{host}}/api/concepts/{{conceptId}}/children?limit=50
###
GET {{host}}/api/concepts/{{conceptId}}/parents
###
GET {{host}}/api/concepts/{{conceptId}}/synonyms

### Concepts per searchable semantic tag
GET {{host}}/api/concepts/semantic-tags
